{"unit_id":"observer130__dsh-peerbar#card-zh","repo":"observer130/dsh-peerbar","commit":"6d1af3d7407f3531d2af064e12d883002cea0592","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peerbar 是面向 DSH Web 与桌面端的远程主机协作插件：它接入 DSH Web 服务和客户端侧栏，把本机与多台远端主机的工作区、会话汇入统一视图，并将会话操作路由到所属主机。用户可查看主机状态、创建和管理远端工作区、操作远端会话，并通过代理查看会话记录、文件变更及终端等流式功能。适合在多台可直连 DSH 主机之间统一管理工作区和继续处理会话；需要登记远端地址和启动令牌，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:138-145","lib/index.js:302-358","lib/client.js:678-740","lib/terminal.js:1-30"]}
{"unit_id":"observer130__dsh-peerbar#card-en","repo":"observer130/dsh-peerbar","commit":"6d1af3d7407f3531d2af064e12d883002cea0592","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-peerbar combines local and remote DSH workspaces and sessions in one sidebar, routing actions to their host. It supports host status, session management, history, file changes, and terminal streams. Add each reachable host address and startup token; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:138-145","lib/index.js:302-358","lib/client.js:678-740","lib/terminal.js:1-30"]}
