{"unit_id":"observer130__dsh-peerbar#caveat-connectivity","repo":"observer130/dsh-peerbar","commit":"6d1af3d7407f3531d2af064e12d883002cea0592","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peerbar 使用前须知：远端 DSH 地址需要能从本机直接通过 HTTP(S) 访问；注册远端主机时要提供其启动令牌，插件据此换取请求用 cookie。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/remote.js:5-8","lib/remote.js:177-205","lib/config.js:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"observer130__dsh-peerbar#caveat-local","repo":"observer130/dsh-peerbar","commit":"6d1af3d7407f3531d2af064e12d883002cea0592","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-peerbar 使用前须知：远端主机令牌和 cookie 会保存在本机注册表文件中，文件写入采用 0600 权限；插件还会在本机数据目录保存状态缓存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/config.js:1-3","lib/config.js:22-27","lib/config.js:40-48"]}
